  "doc": "# Northstar\n\nA shared workspace for a small team with big ideas.\n\n## From first idea to release\n\nDiscuss the idea, change the code, and review the result — in one project.\n\n### In this release\n\n- Responsive navigation for phones and tablets.\n- A project gallery with instant previews.\n- Notes, files, and revision history beside your conversation.\n\n## Quick start\n\n```sh\npnpm install\npnpm dev\n```\n\n### Project structure\n\n| Folder | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| src | Components and pages |\n| public | Images and icons |\n| docs | Decisions and notes |\n\nNext up: prepare the release page.\n",
